// JSON6 - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// JSON6 is JSON with two relaxations: trailing commas and single-quoted
// keys are both legal. The greeting is in an ordinary string value.
{
  greeting: "Hello World!",
}
